    "zh": "复检名单的第二第三笔",
    "en": "Second and Third for Recheck"
  },
  "concept": {
    "zh": "SQL 筛选排序 · 双边温度范围 · 按位置取样",
    "en": "SQL filtering and sorting · Bounded readings · Positional sample"
  },
  "brief": {
    "zh": "校准员只复检车间 24°C 至 32°C（含两端）的有效读数。清单按温度由低到高，同温度按编号由小到大。最低的一笔已另交校准，最终交出清单中第二、第三笔的温度和它们在清单中的索引。",
    "en": "The technician rechecks only valid workshop readings from 24°C through 32°C, inclusive. Sort low to high, with lower IDs first if temperatures tie. The lowest reading was sent separately. Submit the second and third temperatures with their indices in the shortlist."
  },
  "prerequisites": [
    {
      "unit": "database",
      "topic": "sql-rows"
    },
    {
      "unit": "numpy",
      "topic": "masks"
    },
    {
      "unit": "numpy",
      "topic": "arrays"
    }
  ],
  "hints": [],
  "steps": [
